 December 31, 2022 which has been derived from audited financial statements and these unaudited condensed consolidated financial statements reflect all normal and recurring adjustments considered necessary to state fairly the results for the periods presented. The results for the period ended March 31, 2023 are not necessarily indicative of the results to be expected for the entire fiscal year ending December 31, 2023 or for any future period.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NOTE 2 - ORGANIZATION AND BUSINESS BACKGROUND\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Cosmos Group Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (the "Company" or "COSG") was incorporated in the state of Nevada on August 14, 1987.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Company currently offers financial and money lending services in Hong Kong and operates an online platform for the sale and distribution of arts and collectibles around the world, through the use of blockchain technologies and minting token.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 COSMOS GROUP HOLDINGS INC\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NOTES TO UNAUDITED CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31, 2023 AND 2022\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  expressed in United States Dollars ("US$"), except for number of shares)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Description of subsidiaries\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Company name                          Place of incorporation and kind of legal entity    Principal activities and place of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2              Particulars of registered/ paid up share capital          Effective interest held   \par Massive Treasure Limited               BVI, limited liability company                    Investment holding                                       50,000 ordinary shares with a par value of US$1 each                               100   % \par                                                                       