oceeds from any such non-resident enterprise investor's disposition of assets (after deducting the net value of such assets) shall be subject to 10% withholding tax, unless the respective non-PRC resident enterprise's jurisdiction of incorporation has a tax treaty or arrangements with China that provides for a reduced withholding tax rate or an exemption from withholding tax.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-40\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 META DATA LIMITED\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS (CONTINUED)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Amounts in thousands of Renminbi ("RMB") and U.S. dollars ("US$"),\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 except for number of shares and per share data)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 9. Income Taxes (continued)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 PRC (continued)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The reconciliations of the income tax expense for the years ended August 31, 2020, 2021 and 2022 were as follows:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                                                                                  For the years ended August 31,   \par                                                                                                  2020                                            2021                2022       2022       \par                                                                                                  RMB                                             RMB                 RMB        US$        \par Income/(loss) before income tax expense and share of net (loss)/income from equity investees                                      (193,933   )            (109,914   )          (417,307   )       (60,575   ) \par PRC statutory tax rate                                                                                                            25         %            25         %          25         %       25        % \par Income tax/(benefit) at statutory tax rate                                                                         