\par\par \b \uc2 Bill Ackman\uc2  Says He Is Shorting the Hong Kong Dollar -- Barrons.com\b0\par\par\uc2 By Brian Swint \par \uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 November 2022\par 14:47\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2022, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 Bill Ackman\uc2 , the activist investor, said his hedge fund \uc2 Pershing Square\uc2  has built a short position on the Hong Kong dollar.\par \par \uc2 He's betting the peg to the U.S. dollar will break. \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (\uc2 HKMA\uc2 ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar trading between 7.75 to 7.85 against its American counterpart.\par \par \uc2 That has been an expensive undertaking this year as the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 's aggressive rate hikes strengthened the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \uc2 HKMA\uc2  has spent 15% of its reserves so far, equivalent to about $30 billion. That's more than it had to shell out to maintain the peg in the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis of 1997.\par \par \uc2 Propping up the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been made more difficult by a fragile economy. Fresh outbreaks of Covid-19 in mainland China, to which Hong Kong is increasingly tied, have repeatedly led to strict lockdowns.\par \par \uc2 China recently reaffirmed its commitment to zero-Covid policies after its vaccine program proved less effective than those in Western nations, making restrictions on social interactions necessary to save lives.\par \par \uc2 "We have a large notional short position against the Hong Kong dollar through the ownership of put options," Ackman said in a tweet. "The peg no longer makes sense for Hong Kong and it is only a matter of time before it breaks."\par \par \uc2 Write to brian.swint@barrons.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 November 24, 2022 08:47 ET (13:47 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020221124eibo00185\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
