c2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 05-06-20 1012GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020200605eg650008m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
