\par\par \b \uc2 Explainer: How important is Hong Kong to China as a free finance hub?\b0\par\par\uc2 740 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 2020\par 10:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 HONG KONG (Reuters) - Bankers and investors fear China's push to impose national security laws on Hong Kong threaten the city's future as an international financial centre. If it gets to that stage, Beijing's move will come at a cost for China's economy.\par \par \uc2 WHY DOES CHINA NEED HONG KONG AS IT IS?\par \par \uc2 China still has extensive capital controls and often \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its financial markets and banking system. \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of the world's most open economies and one of the biggest channels for equity and debt financing.\par \par \uc2 The size of Hong Kong's economy may only be the equivalent of 2.7% of mainland China's, down from 18.4% in 1997 when it reverted to Chinese rule, but the territory punches above its weight due to world-class financial and legal systems.\par \par \uc2 As a gateway between China and the West, Hong Kong attracts global capital for China more efficiently than its other cities.\par \par \uc2 (GRAPHIC: HK China GDP - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/nmopakjdwpa/HK%20China%20GDP.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/nmopakjdwpa/HK%20China%20GDP.jpg}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 HOW IS THAT CHANGING?\par \par \uc2 Under the 'one country, two systems' formula agreed as part of Britain's handover of the territory to China, Hong Kong is guaranteed liberties unavailable on the mainland such as freedom of expression and an independent judiciary.\par \par \uc2 These freedoms give Hong Kong a special international status -- for instance, it does not have to pay the U.S. tariffs currently hitting Chinese imports.\par \par \uc2 With the \uc2 U.S. State Department\uc2  recommending the removal of that status as it no longer deems Hong Kong sufficiently autonomous from Beijing, measures hitting trade, finance and investments among other areas could follow.\par \par \uc2 Australia, Britain, Canada, the \uc2 European Union\uc2  and others also have expressed concerns over the legislation.\par \par \uc2 (GRAPHIC: HK CN IPO - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/azgvobrzepd/HK%20CN%20IPO.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/azgvobrzepd/HK%20CN%20IPO.jpg}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (GRAPHIC: HK CN DCM - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/gjnpwywbrpw/HK%20CN%20DCM.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/gjnpwywbrpw/HK%20CN%20DCM.jpg}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 WHAT IS AT STAKE?\par \par \uc2 China uses Hong Kong's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , equity and debt markets to attract foreign funds, while international companies use Hong Kong as a launchpad to expand into the mainland.\par \par \uc2 While China has reformed its markets over the years, over 60% of foreign direct investment (FDI) into and out of China continued to be channeled through Hong Kong as of 2018, according to \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Last year, Chinese companies raised $73.8 billion via initial public offerings (IPOs), $35 billion of which was bagged in Hong Kong, according to data from Dealogic.\par \par \uc2 Chinese businesses tapped Hong Kong's debt market for 25% of their $131.8 billion in offshore U.S. dollar funding last year, Refinitiv data shows.\par \par \uc2 Schemes linking stock exchanges in Hong Kong, Shanghai and Shenzhen provide the main gateway for foreigners to buy mainland stocks. A planned opening up of Chinese capital flows only increases the importance of these channels, and ultimately, Hong Kong, Fidelity said in a post this week.\par \par \uc2 (GRAPHIC: CN banks assets HK - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/dgkplwxalvb/CN%20banks%20assets%20HK.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/dgkplwxalvb/CN%20banks%20assets%20HK.jpg}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (GRAPHIC: Assets in HK banks by region - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/qmypmogxkpr/Assets%20in%20HK%20banks%20by%20region.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/mkt/qmypmogxkpr/Assets%20in%20HK%20banks%20by%20region.jpg}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 Chinese banks hold more assets in Hong Kong -- $1.1 trillion in 2019 -- than lenders from any other region, according to \uc2 Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's data compiled by \uc2 Natixis\uc2 . Any squeeze on the massive financing channel risks destabilising the Chinese economy.\par \par \uc2 Among other deep linkages, Hong Kong's port continues to handle some of China's exports and imports, though it has been eclipsed by big Chinese ports in the last few decades.\par \par \uc2 Hong Kong has also been pivotal to China's ambition to turn the yuan into a widely-used international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , competing with the U.S. dollar and increasing its global influence.\par \par \uc2 HOW COULD IT ALL UNRAVEL?\par \par \uc2 The pandemic has prompted central banks around the world to flood markets with new liquidity. Money that would normally seek a home in Hong Kong may just choose other centres, such as Singapore, in time diminishing the city's significance.\par \par \uc2 Capital already in Hong Kong could also choose to move outside the scope of mainland legislation and escape disruptions from local social unrest and any international restrictions. Outflows so far have been limited, bankers said.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Noah Sin; Editing by Marius Zaharia and Kim Coghill) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-5-29T08:32:11.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200529eg5t01cdp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
